{"4393600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bird Breakout", "steam_appid": 4393600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bird Breakout is a third person horror adventure game in which you play a corvid trying to find freedom. Explore the place you find yourself trapped in and break free. Bird beware, the facility will not let you go easily, and it will prey on your weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have no memory, save a few images from your days as a chick. You don't know anything about where you are confined, or why. You will meet shadowy and sunny figures to interact with on your journey, but who can you trust? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an eclectic blend, with sprinkles of platforming and absurdism within a bleak dystopian adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are injured, you cannot fly for very long, and you cannot fight. You must flee or hide from any enemies you encounter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be a main storyline, in which you unravel mysteries and find a place where you can truly spread your wings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will also be bonus levels, where you can test your abilities to navigate and escape various locations as fast as possible.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bird Breakout is a third person horror adventure game in which you play a corvid trying to find freedom. Explore the place you find yourself trapped in and break free. Bird beware, the facility will not let you go easily, and it will prey on your weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have no memory, save a few images from your days as a chick. You don't know anything about where you are confined, or why. You will meet shadowy and sunny figures to interact with on your journey, but who can you trust? <